<title>UK: Pakistan tenders to buy 50,000 t white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan tenders to buy 50,000 t white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan has issued a tender to buy a total 50,000 tonnes of white sugar in two equal shipments, trade sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>It would hold the first tender on July 31 and the second on August 15, they said. Details of the exact shipment periods have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>Last month, Pakistan was said to have bought one cargo of white sugar at $351 a tonne.</p>
